<title>USA: Regis acquires eight salons.</title>
<headline>Regis acquires eight salons.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regis Corp said Monday it acquired eight beauty salons, including five in Nashville, Tenn. and the others in Johnson City, Tenn., Kingsport, Tenn. and Bristol, Va.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The acquired salons generate about $2.5 million in annual sales.</p>
<p>Including these transactions, Regis has completed 50 acquisitions in the past 35 months, adding 494 salons and about $121 million in annual sales. Regis currently operates and franchises 3,185 hair salons in six divisions.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
